Time flies, right?

122
00:10:56,332 --> 00:10:56,732
早いね。
It really does.

123
00:10:56,832 --> 00:11:03,432
はい。えー好きなものは人間と音声合成ボカロイドが大好きなのじゃ！
Yes! Um, I love humans and vocal synthesizers/Vocaloids so much, noja!

124
00:11:04,132 --> 00:11:05,132
いいですね。
That's wonderful.

125
00:11:05,532 --> 00:11:08,932
